      "description": "<p>Declares a storage buffer uniform inside a <a href=\"#/p5.Shader/modify\">modify()</a> callback,\nmaking a <a href=\"#/p5/createStorage\">createStorage()</a> buffer accessible in the shader.</p>\n<p>Pass a <code>p5.StorageBuffer</code> (or a function returning one) as the second argument\nto set it as the default value, applied automatically each frame. Pass a plain\nobject with the same field layout as the buffer's struct elements to declare the\nschema without binding a specific buffer.</p>\n<p>When called without a name, p5.strands automatically uses the name of the\nvariable it is assigned to as the uniform name.</p>\n<p>Note: <code>uniformStorage</code> is only available when using p5.strands.</p>\n",
