              "type": "BLEND|DARKEST|LIGHTEST|DIFFERENCE|MULTIPLY|EXCLUSION|SCREEN|REPLACE|OVERLAY|HARD_LIGHT|SOFT_LIGHT|DODGE|BURN|ADD|REMOVE|SUBTRACT"
